17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "ee010cfb-abc6-50d2-bc11-922a83415c8c" :question/problem "What is the graph of $y=\\arcsin x$?" :question/worked-solution "Let's recall some of the basic properties of $y=\\arcsin x$:\n\n- The domain of the function is $x\\in[-1,1]$.\n- The range of the function is $y\\in[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}]$.\n- Its minimum value occurs at $x=-1$.\n- Its maximum value occurs at $x=1$.\n- Its zero occurs at $x=0$.\n- The function is strictly increasing on its entire domain.\n\nOf the given graphs, the only one that has all of these properties is as follows:\n\n![](images/df/df22eea4331c47da3047381ca672fd80ebf75118054316fe88c0e2d96dae0d34.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676536 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c498ea9-5b57-5d02-ba93-e5238f5e175b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{25}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676552} {:answer/id #uuid "51e6a567-15e0-5bb3-9346-244f71b4e83a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676583} {:answer/id #uuid "73afaad6-3cc0-5ad1-b38f-24a51fbfb172" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{25}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676605} {:answer/id #uuid "a82aab25-2af8-5c79-9225-5a8532b62969" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{25}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676638} {:answer/id #uuid "c7e001ab-cad0-5388-aeb9-ba256ce34f46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(5 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676660}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676552} :answer-field/id #uuid "28988c58-40b0-5576-90c1-baecb434fc34" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676557}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "00c0df7b-f3f7-5aef-8a44-20715d50042d" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\frac{1}{5}}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=5 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{\\frac{1}{5}}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(5 x)^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{5})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{25}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{25}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{25}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676540 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11a0a2dd-94b9-53c9-acb5-8f1bb994d149" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{7 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\right)}}{20}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676547} {:answer/id #uuid "39952f53-b06e-5af0-b589-c1f02ec472cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\right)}}{20}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676567} {:answer/id #uuid "a8655662-941b-56fe-9d9a-9ab0306c63a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{20}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676639} {:answer/id #uuid "bbf69c40-a265-50fd-8f13-97eeaa5edcfa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\right)}}{100}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676652} {:answer/id #uuid "d9f32989-1267-56b3-88cb-4f9850104bb9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\right)}}{20}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676673}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676567} :answer-field/id #uuid "62aed248-e6f8-5802-92f0-41cfc63b825b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676595}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "06700047-ad1d-5b16-8026-a95be4f4bee9" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\frac{7}{4}}{\\sqrt{25 - 5 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{25 - 5 x^{2}}=\\sqrt{25(1-(\\frac{1}{5})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\sqrt{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{\\frac{7}{4}}{\\sqrt{25 - 5 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{20}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{7}{20}(\\sqrt{5})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5}}{20}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{20}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{7 \\sqrt{5} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\right)}}{20}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676553 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f664ff5-8ad0-5fbb-a886-4102a1c3c4e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676582} {:answer/id #uuid "69ae4778-cd6b-5818-b92e-5784218e6a03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676602} {:answer/id #uuid "7b27ebf9-81c0-5186-b894-864e87744f47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676609} {:answer/id #uuid "af9ea903-410b-595e-b44f-e4a2c4960f1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\right)}}{25}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676645} {:answer/id #uuid "ee1773d2-c55c-5fa1-ab0f-590df321fdcd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676689}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676582} :answer-field/id #uuid "19bcada3-da05-5238-a175-fffd984e8c80" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676548}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "1df3778e-4e82-53f7-a9f2-51a498e80f46" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - 10 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{25 - 10 x^{2}}=\\sqrt{25(1-(\\frac{2}{5})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{5}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{5},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - 10 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{5})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{4}{5}(\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2})\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\sqrt{10}}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{2 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\right)}}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676574 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b389124-a26d-50e1-aa90-68db0abe6c2e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676560} {:answer/id #uuid "6ce3c644-d7bd-5af0-90aa-621960980866" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "8 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676603} {:answer/id #uuid "7a84aeb3-7c9d-5ea6-b305-0a4fa5dacfc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676608} {:answer/id #uuid "f1395054-873c-52c8-b347-999eeb014cf8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676694} {:answer/id #uuid "f638c343-9c97-5913-bd31-5df078a1a1f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676696}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676696} :answer-field/id #uuid "00