0ce921df9" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{8}{\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{64(1-(\\frac{1}{64})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{8}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{8},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(8)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{8}{\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{8})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1(8)\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 8\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= 8 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676617 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7c7e6666-22ee-50eb-97f6-e9342b017d03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676610} {:answer/id #uuid "90fd7807-ac81-5841-8275-8d5bd923a884" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676620} {:answer/id #uuid "97c341f9-c5f4-5b33-a520-f32acebf91b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676625} {:answer/id #uuid "da83ea42-6426-5bd3-80cb-0ca878cf408f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676674} {:answ