\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{64(1-(\\frac{1}{64})x^{2})}\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{8}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{8},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(8)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{8})^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}(8)\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676686 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08ef48eb-bfc4-5b6f-bcfa-a949fb85d64e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676543} {:answer/id #uuid "836b8e2a-0a2f-57de-ab5a-09f3325f52ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{12}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676614} {:answer/id #uuid "9da912b7-c82a-588d-aad3-9405b645cb2b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{108}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676631} {:answer/id #uuid "c6770fe8-a44d-5ea7-a39f-9b0d266ce530" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(x \\right)}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676658} {:answer/id #uuid "eeac7f1b-0800-5c25-bcb3-956419b51d97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb