0671ff" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 64}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 64=64(1+(\\frac{1}{64})x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{8}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{8},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(8)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 64}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{64}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{x}{8})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{64}(8)\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{8}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{8}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{8} \\right)}}{8}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676784 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2e8e958b-c343-5170-816b-4e648ead370c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "16 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(8 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676739} {:answer/id #uuid "3f7c3f4c-d1c9-5343-98d1-9dc76c21ae47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(8 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676751} {:answer/id #uuid "64f43cea-82e3-5cf1-9cbf-43842411bb39" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676770} {:answer/id #uuid "70e02059-973f-581c-a1d3-bc66b391d5bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676781} {:answer/id #uuid "9c524791-e707-5343-b791-1b1e03c75f52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676802}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676802} :answer-field/id #uuid "b17f2626-b155-58de-9d66-8d6cd21bf664" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676818}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "785a58d5-601a-50af-b1f2-100d273d37ef" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{64 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=8 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=8,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{8})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{2}{64 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 2\\int \\frac{1}{1+(8 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 2(\\frac{1}{8})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{4}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{4}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676795 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3136ef37-a6a8-58b1-8d37-940fe10b3ceb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676742} {:answer/id #uuid "3b2d3090-8fca-5042-8512-98ecf1afe80a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676748} {:answer/id #uuid "647c93b4-4022-57a8-8a6f-d883df9071c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\