onometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{9}{4 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 9\\int \\frac{1}{1+(2 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 9(\\frac{1}{2})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{9}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{9 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{9 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676822 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "005d9c54-9266-5ad7-9027-c1f978649698" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{7}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676704} {:answer/id #uuid "813d1154-44eb-5e02-8ecd-d8dc89caec0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{27 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{7}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676786} {:answer/id #uuid "e0df5488-8162-525d-9423-9d533e200638" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}}{7}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676850} {:answer/id #uuid "e6923f62-a9bc-5fcf-96b2-d18caaa3229f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{9 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{7}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676855} {:answer/id #uuid "e91c1dff-d486-5d65-a46a-5ff5bfd1c7e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{7}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676858}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676704} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce568bb9-c592-5247-881c-e3509e33d4c4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676836}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "b65f9d67-eac4-5c1b-ba55-093731e10653" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{9}{63 x^{2} + 7}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n63 x^{2} + 7=7(1+(9)x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=3 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{9}{63 x^{2} + 7}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{9}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(3 x)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{9}{7}(\\frac{1}{3})\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{3}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{7}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{3 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{7}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676832 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "077df066-c1a9-5bdd-aba4-16684f634732" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{10}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676710} {:answer/id #uuid "3161d050-8c20-530d-a5d6-f952f5390501" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676743} {:answer/id #uuid "afe90c87-9ef0-5590-a880-7890c3b7c5a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}}{10}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676815} {:answer/id #uuid "f9c317fa-bb92-55a0-a62a-26a5b44699c0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{10} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\sqrt{10} x \\right)}}{10}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676870} {:answer/id #uui