)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{6}{x^{2} + 36}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{x}{6})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{6}(6)\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676845 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07c26e54-2294-5687-b4c5-58f8778f2ab7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{729}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676712} {:answer/id #uuid "23910027-5f13-5a3c-a6de-adda6a244240" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}}{9}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676728} {:answer/id #uuid "84377d13-d7eb-5c20-a86b-157b73f6458f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{9}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676788} {:answer/id #uuid "ca7464c5-dcbc-552b-8052-445cd47479f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{81}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676833} {:answer/id #uuid "e5fb92f8-0d6d-5ea0-9d2d-71d67d6a0775" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{9}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676854}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676854} :answer-field/id #uuid "f2b10e7e-0247-5cb6-93d0-182d84a3d991" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676865}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "dbb54453-224c-5927-8847-fd39bd2a8cdb" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 81}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "First factor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 81=81(1+(\\frac{1}{81})x^{2})\n$$\n\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\frac{x}{9}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{9},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(9)\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 81}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{81}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\frac{x}{9})^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{81}(9)\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{9}\\int \\frac{1}{1+u^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(u \\right)}}{9}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{x}{9} \\right)}}{9}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676849 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "222dd6f4-b70d-53fe-9d18-4de408229685" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\right)}}{9}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676727} {:answer/id #uuid "2817e13a-038f-58d5-b082-6b005cef9595" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\right)}}{27}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676731} {:answer/id #uuid "2ca2ef99-5d02-54a2-af4e-eba2f7bbb221" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(x \\right)}}{9}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676736} {:answer/id #uuid "3cc982a9-0b51-5b09-97da-0bd0b7e71c5a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\right)}}{9}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676749} {:answer/id #uuid "4ac19d27-e1ff-5965-