 $u=6 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{6})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nThe substitution factor is positive, so the absolute values satisfy\n\n$$\n|u|=|6 x|=6|x|,\\qquad \\frac{1}{|x|}=\\frac{6}{|u|}.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{36 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 30\\int \\frac{1}{|6 x|\\sqrt{(6 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 30(\\frac{1}{6})\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 5\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 5 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= 5 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(6 x \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis antiderivative applies on either interval where $|6 x|>1$; the constant may differ between those intervals."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676920 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "15e65e07-085b-550a-a717-82d2d0a4449f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{64}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676887} {:answer/id #uuid "1d199601-926c-5873-9d3f-90aebc32fddf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{8}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676891} {:answer/id #uuid "b71fa791-be0c-5a48-a50c-ab3294c89e93" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676991} {:answer/id #uuid "e2e87151-dca4-5f40-a571-21cca555c271" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}}{8}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677018} {:answer/id #uuid "fc8cda26-f6db-5986-9ef8-10b89f69beda" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\